{"schemaVersion":1,"basis":{"snapshot":"18dbe44a94c58882d91a6cfb13b550f7a96ad37b7453e3d5336952e40f05776b","analysisRevision":4,"compilerVersion":"5.9.3","config":"tsconfig.json"},"expectedRevision":9,"baseDigest":"e255fe3f832e7cf5e650987afadd376a8862cf4cd44cc0d6c76851b0654fe35a","batchId":"notification-reviewed-draft","scope":"桌面通知展示、点击处理以及前台会話的通知开关边界","unexplored":["告警何时从采集状态生成。","系统通知投递、OS事件派发与焦点切换的真实执行效果。","静音、通知类型偏好和已读持久化尚未跟踪。"],"features":[{"id":"desktop-alert-interaction","title":"桌面告警展示与点击处理","description":"在主进程告警回调放行且系统支持通知时，请求显示原生提醒。第0个动作按钮请求确认当前告警；正文点击在未处理过时先请求确认并关闭通知，再调用会话导航回调。两者共用重复处理标记。这里不确认操作系统投递、已读持久化或成功聚焦。","questions":["事件回调及参数目标有静态候选依据，不代表实际触发或所有调用者已覆盖。","系统焦点限制与真正的已读持久化未验证；注册周围的try/catch不能证明捕获后续回调的异常。"]},{"id":"foreground-popup-gate","title":"前台会话的弹窗抑制","description":"主进程告警分发前对会话前台状态做最后一层弹窗筛选：前台会话的弹窗路径提前返回。数据源异常/恢复告警绕过此筛选；前台检测抛出异常时放行，检测器缺失时主调用方传入false而放行。本功能不是全局静音，也未证明收件箱或已读状态不变。","questions":["前台检测的OS准确性与事件到达时序没有运行验证。","未沿上游偏好设置、收件箱和已读持久化建立完整功能链。"]}],"mappings":[{"op":"mapping","id":"desktop-dispatch","featureId":"desktop-alert-interaction","nodeId":"node:021d9a84c4fe2011462b","role":"entry","rationale":"告警接入点在前台筛选通过后调用showDesktopAlert并传入导航和确认回调；不把上游告警生成纳入本提案。","relationIds":["edge:625df3e0013a252dc9a0","edge:94c46f43f501f7a02b5a"]},{"op":"mapping","id":"desktop-show","featureId":"desktop-alert-interaction","nodeId":"node:9858e7c407e3914c9797","role":"implementation","rationale":"实际原生通知适配实现；创建及show依赖外部Electron。on注册只建立回调传入关系，不证明点击发生。","relationIds":["edge:57349558e280f06402b1","edge:0e43ac364bfd3a7e4890","edge:348ec5c68d05d2e62eaa"]},{"op":"mapping","id":"desktop-click","featureId":"desktop-alert-interaction","nodeId":"node:bfb0e7a4467dc6930035","role":"implementation","rationale":"正文点击先阻止重复处理，再调用 acknowledge、关闭通知并调用 focus。","relationIds":["edge:c0d7ad759792b2c8e88b","edge:4c4d36ebb808e92b7114"]},{"op":"mapping","id":"desktop-action","featureId":"desktop-alert-interaction","nodeId":"node:374a41c0488a69895235","role":"implementation","rationale":"动作按钮只在第0项且未处理时确认当前事件并关闭通知。","relationIds":["edge:abab8605a14291408c4e"]},{"op":"mapping","id":"foreground-entry","featureId":"foreground-popup-gate","nodeId":"node:021d9a84c4fe2011462b","role":"entry","rationale":"分发回调使用 shouldDisplayNativeAlert 的返回值提前返回，否则进入 showDesktopAlert。","relationIds":["edge:9cb3dbace0fd9d9e628b","edge:625df3e0013a252dc9a0"]},{"op":"mapping","id":"foreground-rule","featureId":"foreground-popup-gate","nodeId":"node:6ca9280fabc03c880cf1","role":"implementation","rationale":"判定会话前台状态、绕过数据源告警，并在检测异常时放行。","relationIds":["edge:0bb95068ab0b594d2de1"]},{"op":"mapping","id":"desktop-focus-adapter","featureId":"desktop-alert-interaction","nodeId":"node:ebb6521aea3081e0a2c5","role":"support","rationale":"点击后可能调用的导航适配：数据源走主窗口；缺失monitor/windowTracker时回到主窗口。这里只支持导航请求与回退，不承诺找到具体标签或焦点成功。","relationIds":["edge:4c4d36ebb808e92b7114"]}],"checks":[{"featureId":"desktop-alert-interaction","nodeId":"node:9858e7c407e3914c9797","kind":"support","quote":"notice.show();","explanation":"有实际请求显示的调用位置，不证明系统一定显示。"},{"featureId":"desktop-alert-interaction","nodeId":"node:9858e7c407e3914c9797","kind":"limit","quote":"if (!Notification.isSupported()) return;","explanation":"系统不支持时不进入创建通知。"},{"featureId":"foreground-popup-gate","nodeId":"node:6ca9280fabc03c880cf1","kind":"support","quote":"return !isSessionForeground(alert.sessionKey);","explanation":"将会话前台检测结果取反作为放行结果。"},{"featureId":"foreground-popup-gate","nodeId":"node:6ca9280fabc03c880cf1","kind":"limit","quote":"if (isSourceAlertKind(alert.kind)) return true;","explanation":"数据源告警不因会话前台而受此规则抑制。"},{"featureId":"desktop-alert-interaction","nodeId":"node:bfb0e7a4467dc6930035","kind":"support","quote":"acknowledge(alert.id);","explanation":"正文点击处理器明确请求确认该告警，不能推出持久化成功。"},{"featureId":"desktop-alert-interaction","nodeId":"node:bfb0e7a4467dc6930035","kind":"support","quote":"focus(alert.sessionKey);","explanation":"正文点击后请求导航；参数来源候选和open-callers边界保留。"},{"featureId":"desktop-alert-interaction","nodeId":"node:bfb0e7a4467dc6930035","kind":"limit","quote":"if (acknowledged) return;","explanation":"同通知已处理时不再执行点击主体。"},{"featureId":"desktop-alert-interaction","nodeId":"node:374a41c0488a69895235","kind":"support","quote":"acknowledge(alert.id);","explanation":"动作按钮调用确认；在已读动作中没有正文点击的focus调用。"},{"featureId":"desktop-alert-interaction","nodeId":"node:374a41c0488a69895235","kind":"limit","quote":"if (actionIndex !== 0 || acknowledged) return;","explanation":"非第0动作或重复处理提前返回，不能声称任意动作都会确认。"},{"featureId":"desktop-alert-interaction","nodeId":"node:ebb6521aea3081e0a2c5","kind":"limit","quote":"if (!monitor || !windowTracker) { mainWindow?.show(key); return; }","explanation":"缺少导航依赖时回退主窗口；不保证原会话焦点成功。"},{"featureId":"foreground-popup-gate","nodeId":"node:6ca9280fabc03c880cf1","kind":"limit","quote":"} catch {\n    // A failed/disabled OS watcher should never silently lose notifications.\n    return true;","explanation":"检测器抛异常时放行，不是严格的任何情况下前台都静默。"},{"featureId":"foreground-popup-gate","nodeId":"node:021d9a84c4fe2011462b","kind":"support","quote":"monitor?.recordPopup(alert.sessionKey, true);\n          return;","explanation":"主调用方确实根据规则提前结束弹窗分发；不据此证明其他存储状态。"},{"featureId":"foreground-popup-gate","nodeId":"node:021d9a84c4fe2011462b","kind":"limit","quote":"key => windowTracker?.isSessionForeground(key) ?? false","explanation":"检测器缺失时提供false，结合规则会放行。"}]}
